    <string name="section_help">How to use</string>
    <string-array name="steps">
        <item>Turn on the Auto Clicker accessibility service.</item>
        <item>On the floating panel, use the target button to add a tap and the arrow button to add a swipe. Drag the markers into place.</item>
        <item>Actions run in number order. Tap a marker to give that action its own delay or duration, or to delete it.</item>
        <item>Press play to start and stop to end. Drag the bar at the top of the panel to move it.</item>
        <item>Save setups you use often under Macros and load them later.</item>
    </string-array>

